WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.948
The next morning, Vinnie overslept.

2
00:00:05.949 --> 00:00:08.745
He ran to the attic.

3
00:00:08.746 --> 00:00:13.336
He wanted to make sure their trip to Egypt wasn’t a dream.

4
00:00:13.337 --> 00:00:16.542
He hoped Mandy was already there.

5
00:00:16.543 --> 00:00:18.818
But she wasn’t.

6
00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:24.680
Disappointed, Vinnie came downstairs and went outside.

7
00:00:24.681 --> 00:00:27.802
His dad was about to mow the lawn.

8
00:00:27.803 --> 00:00:31.821
"Dad," said Vinnie, "where’s Mandy?"

9
00:00:31.822 --> 00:00:35.867
"She went shopping with Mom," Dad replied.

10
00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:38.076
He couldn’t believe it.

11
00:00:38.077 --> 00:00:42.409
"Doesn’t she want to go on another photo trip?" he thought.

12
00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:45.816
Suddenly Vinnie had an idea.

13
00:00:45.817 --> 00:00:48.800
"What if I go by myself?

14
00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:52.238
Mandy won’t even know I’m gone!"

15
00:00:52.239 --> 00:00:55.424
Vinnie raced back to the attic.

16
00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:59.278
He took the photo of Egypt out of his pocket.

17
00:00:59.279 --> 00:01:03.342
He stared. The picture had changed.

18
00:01:03.343 --> 00:01:08.112
The old man and the eagle in the boat were gone.

19
00:01:08.113 --> 00:01:13.298
In their places sat Vinnie and Mandy.

20
00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:20.952
"Every time we come back from a photo trip," Vinnie thought, "will we be in the picture?

21
00:01:20.953 --> 00:01:23.670
There’s only one way to find out."

22
00:01:23.671 --> 00:01:29.000
Vinnie carefully put the picture of Egypt into the photo album.

23
00:01:29.001 --> 00:01:32.800
His heart began to race as he turned the page.

24
00:01:32.801 --> 00:01:39.116
In the next photo, the old man was sitting near a brightly glowing object.

25
00:01:39.117 --> 00:01:42.046
He was at the bottom of some steps.

26
00:01:42.047 --> 00:01:44.806
Vinnie took the photo out.

27
00:01:44.807 --> 00:01:50.028
"The next adventure begins," Vinnie said excitedly.

28
00:01:50.029 --> 00:01:55.491
Suddenly, the attic door swung open and Mandy ran in.

29
00:01:55.492 --> 00:02:00.844
"I knew you’d be here!" she shouted angrily.

30
00:02:00.845 --> 00:02:03.034
"No time to argue!"

31
00:02:03.035 --> 00:02:05.957
Vinnie said, grabbing her arm.

32
00:02:05.958 --> 00:02:09.618
"Look!" He showed her the new photo.

33
00:02:09.619 --> 00:02:14.371
Mandy stared. "Where is this?" she asked.

34
00:02:14.372 --> 00:02:19.622
Before Vinnie could answer, the picture glowed very brightly.

35
00:02:19.623 --> 00:02:22.696
The children had to close their eyes.

36
00:02:22.697 --> 00:02:26.555
Soon they were falling down a deep dark tunnel.

37
00:02:26.556 --> 00:02:30.101
"Whoa!"

38
00:02:30.102 --> 00:02:33.149
"Ouch!"

39
00:02:33.150 --> 00:02:37.419
Vinnie and Mandy landed heavily on wet ground.

40
00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:41.483
"We landed in mud!" Mandy said.

41
00:02:41.484 --> 00:02:43.543
Their clothes were changed.

42
00:02:43.544 --> 00:02:46.705
She wore a sleeveless cotton dress.

43
00:02:46.706 --> 00:02:49.942
Vinnie wore something like a short skirt.

44
00:02:49.943 --> 00:02:52.363
"Where are we?"

45
00:02:52.364 --> 00:02:54.681
Mandy looked around.

46
00:02:54.682 --> 00:02:59.136
"We’re on a tiny island!" Vinnie cried.

47
00:02:59.137 --> 00:03:01.215
"I think we’re in a lake!"

48
00:03:01.216 --> 00:03:05.745
Vinnie noticed that Mandy wore a sparkly bead bracelet.

49
00:03:05.746 --> 00:03:09.671
"What’s that?" Vinnie asked.

50
00:03:09.672 --> 00:03:13.414
"Mom bought it for me," said Mandy.

51
00:03:13.415 --> 00:03:16.307
"It’s an early birthday present."

52
00:03:16.308 --> 00:03:21.559
"Why did you come home from shopping so quickly?" her brother asked.

53
00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:26.409
"Mom forgot her grocery list, so we had to come back."

54
00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:31.673
Mandy remembered that Vinnie almost went on this trip alone.

55
00:03:31.674 --> 00:03:37.682
"Hey! You went to the attic without me," she scolded.

56
00:03:37.683 --> 00:03:40.473
"So?" said Vinnie.

57
00:03:40.474 --> 00:03:43.959
"You didn’t have to go shopping!"

58
00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:47.953
The children argued, forgetting where they were.

59
00:03:47.954 --> 00:03:51.815
Suddenly someone jumped out of the water.

60
00:03:51.816 --> 00:03:55.478
Mandy screamed and startled Vinnie.

61
00:03:55.479 --> 00:04:03.057
He jumped backward, slipped, and fell into the lake.

